        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sat Nov 22, 10am | Strauss’s elegant romance brings the glamour and enchantment of 19th-century Vienna to cinemas worldwide in a sumptuous production by legendary director Otto Schenk that “is as beautiful as one could hope” (The New York Times). Soprano Rachel Willis-Sørensen stars as the title heroine, a young noblewoman in search of love on her own [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
