    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Tue Oct 14, 7:30pm | Widely hailed as one of Canada’s most distinguished pianists, Angela Cheng brings dazzling technique, expressive depth, and a luminous touch to every performance. A gold medalist at the Arthur Rubinstein Piano Masters Competition and the first Canadian to win the Montreal International Piano Competition, Cheng has performed at Carnegie Hall, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
